l infrastructure for Rust-based development on Cardano.\n\nTxPipe has received funding through multiple Cardano ecosystem programs, including Project Catalyst (Funds 9 through 14) for various tooling initiatives, and Intersect's budget process for ongoing maintenance of Pallas, Dolos, and UTxO RPC. All contracts are on track, with milestones being…\n# Criterion to evaluate\n**Value for money**\nTotal ask is proportionate to estimated impact and market norms.\n\nJudgment call: is the total ADA ask proportionate to the work and the realistic impact? Compare against market rates for similar work, the team size, and the expected outcomes. A multi-million USD ask for a docs site is poor value; the same amount for a year of infrastructure R\u0026D might be reasonable.\n# What I need from you\n1. Verdict: YES / NO / UNCLEAR — does this proposal meet the criterion?\n2. Confidence: LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH\n3. A short rationale (3–6 sentences) citing sources you actually checked (GitHub repos, Catalyst project pages, X/Twitter accounts, articles). Be honest if the public info is thin or the proposer's track-record claims need independent verification.\nPlease err on the side of \"UNCLEAR\" with explanation rather tha…2c:[\"$\",\"div\",\"financial\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-[color:var(--border)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3 border-b border-[color:var(--border)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elevated)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-[color:var(--fg-heading)]\",\"children\":\"Financial structure\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0.5 text-xs text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]\",\"children\":\"Is the ask sized and shaped sensibly?\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs tabular-nums\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]\",\"children\":[3,