 ecosystem since 2021, maintaining a portfolio of interconnected tools that serve as foundational infrastructure for Rust-based development on Cardano.\n\nTxPipe has received funding through multiple Cardano ecosystem programs, including Project Catalyst (Funds 9 through 14) for various tooling initiatives, and Intersect's budget process for ongoing maintenance of Pallas, Dolos, and UTxO RPC. All contracts are on track, with milestones being…\n# Criterion to evaluate\n**Not a duplicate of an existing solution**\nNo equivalent existing solution covers this, or this is meaningfully different.\n\nDoes an existing solution already cover what this proposal asks for? If 'yes', the treasury is being asked to fund work that already exists. If 'partial', there's overlap and the proposer needs to show how this is meaningfully different. 'No' or 'unknown' passes.\n# What I need from you\n1. Verdict: YES / NO / UNCLEAR — does this proposal meet the criterion?\n2. Confidence: LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH\n3. A short rationale (3–6 sentences) citing sources you actually checked (GitHub repos, Catalyst project pages, X/Twitter accounts, articles). Be honest if the public info is thin or the proposer's track-record claims need independent verification.\nPlease err on the side of \"UNCLEAR\" with explanation rather th…47:[\"$\",\"tr\",\"not-duplicate\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[color:var(--border)] align-top last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 pr-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Not a duplicate of an existing solution\"}],[\"$\",\"$L22\",null,{\"label\":\"Not a duplicate of an existing solution\",\"body\":\"Does an existing solution already cover what this proposal asks for? If 'yes', the treasury is being asked to fund work that already exists. If 'partial', there's overlap and the proposer needs to show how this is meaningfully different