ructure company focused on building open-source developer tooling in Rust. The team has been active in the Cardano ecosystem since 2021, maintaining a portfolio of interconnected tools that serve as foundational infrastructure for Rust-based development on Cardano.\n\nTxPipe has received funding through multiple Cardano ecosystem programs, including Project Catalyst (Funds 9 through 14) for various tooling initiatives, and Intersect's budget process for ongoing maintenance of Pallas, Dolos, and UTxO RPC. All contracts are on track, with milestones being…\n# Criterion to evaluate\n**Addresses active ecosystem demand**\nReal builders or users are asking for this and would adopt it. Not just a plausible idea — there is observable demand from existing projects or users.\n\nIs there real, observable demand from Cardano builders or users for this work? Strong demand means named users or integrators are asking for it and would adopt it. 'None' means it's a plausible idea but no one is current"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ly using or asking for the thing being built. An upgrade to a tool with zero current users would fail this.\n# What I need from you\n1. Verdict: YES / NO / UNCLEAR — does this proposal meet the criterion?\n2. Confidence: LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH\n3. A short rationale (3–6 sentences) citing sources you actually checked (GitHub repos, Catalyst project pages, X/Twitter accounts, articles). Be honest if the public info is thin or…4a:[\"$\",\"tr\",\"addresses-active-demand\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[color:var(--border)] align-top last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 pr-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Addresses active ecosystem demand\"}],[\"$\",\"$L22\",null,{\"label\":\"Addresses active ecosystem demand\",\"body\":\"Is there real, observable demand from Cardano builders or users for this work? Stron